    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Mapa Agentów i Botów",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Mapa Operacyjna\n\n```text\nGovernance\n  system_lead_agent\n    ├─ review_agent\n    └─ architecture_agent (on-demand)\n\nPlatform\n  control_layer_agent\n    ├─ ops_observability_agent\n    ├─ integration_agent (manual)\n    ├─ api_agent (disabled)\n    └─ gui_agent (disabled)\n\nStrategy / Research\n  strategy_agent\n    ├─ regime_model_agent\n    ├─ feature_engineering_agent\n    ├─ risk_research_agent\n    ├─ experiment_evaluation_agent (manual)\n    ├─ alpha_research_agent (disabled)\n    └─ stewards (disabled by default)\n\nFutures Runtime\n  regime_engine -> risk_desk -> strategy_layer -> execution_runtime\n      -> ft_trend_pullback_continuation_v1\n      -> ft_breakout_from_compression_v1\n      -> ft_range_mean_reversion_v1\n      -> ft_panic_reversal_v1\n      -> ft_defense_only_v1\n```\n\n**Kolory i stany czytaj przez panele obok:**\n- aktywna praca: `Kto czym się zajmuje`\n- plan i kierunek: `Najbliższy plan / kierunek`\n- risk/runtime/strategy: `Runtime / risk / strategy layer`\n- błędy: `Błędy i blockery`\n- przepływ pracy: `Handoffs`\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
